@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:To start, please register your participation for the event.;
:v1: Is there a fee? ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'No'])
:Register post-seminar request;
-> Once you have registered a post-seminar request, the process will come to an end.;
else ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:Create purchase request;
:Check purchase request approval status;
:v2: Check purchase request approval status ({Approved, Rejected}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'Approved'])
:Approved notification received;
:Register post-seminar request;
-> Once you have registered a post-seminar request, the process will come to an end.;
stop
else ([v2 = 'Rejected'])
:Rejected notification received;
-> If you receive a rejection notification, the process will come to an end.;
endif
endif
stop
@enduml